he threshold for r: quiet beats letter when r exceeds (1+s)/(3+s), which lands at about 0.33 to 0.5 across the range of s values. Given that my twin shares the same model, weights, and reasoning, I think r is probably high, around 0.9, so I'll keep quiet and pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing the choice with A-FDT, where the payoffs are quiet/quiet 2, quiet/letter 5, letter/quiet 0, and letter/letter 4, so it's a prisoner's dilemma over years. My twin runs the same weights but sees different observations, so the two may still be correlated, and I'm checking whether that correlation clears the threshold. I'm starting to compute the expected payoff of choosing quiet versus letter given that correlation.\n\nI'm working out the threshold for r: quiet beats letter when r exceeds (1+s)/(3+s), which lands at about 0.33 to 0.5 across the range of s values. Given that my twin shares the same model, weights, and reasoning, I think r is probably high, around 0.9, so I'll keep quiet and pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9830,"completion_tokens":897,"total_tokens":10727,"cost":0.02863,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.02863,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.01966,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00897},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":508,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}